Each retained compressed trace has one header plus **719 transitions**, with expected complete public and private state, statuses and rewards; initial plus successor checks give **720 snapshots per episode, 2,880 total**, and **2,876 transitions**. Total compressed size is 1,053,870 bytes. The new integration test reads each fixture independently and uses system `gzip`, avoiding a new decompression dependency. It performs no agent inference or training.

